{"title":"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Ten tiles numbered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> are turned face down. One tile is turned up at random, and a die is rolled. What is the probability that the product of the numbers on the tile and the die will be a square?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/a/afad31decec147072e55580ff6cdcf4ea6bc69a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{10}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{6}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{11}{60}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{5}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{7}{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"398\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZqPFm9cU0MY\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZqPFm9cU0MY</a>   ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The numbers can at most multiply to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The squares less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/1/3015585dccff764d4896cebd814ab67163dd9aaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,4,9,16,25,36,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"126\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />. The possible pairs are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/c/0bcb2010bdbedbabc8c2447b0c42e32099cf33dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,1),(1,4),(2,2),(4,1),(3,3),(9,1),(4,4),(8,2),(5,5),(6,6),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"480\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/8/0c8d4a6ad1afb93bca130d4ecdf276df2a12ff41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(9,4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> choices and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> possibilities giving a probability of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/7/8f74ae51404d5534e72995e522f8b730543ba470.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{11}{60}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"68\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 8\">2008 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2008\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 